"A zone offset must be in the range %1..%2 inclusive. %3 is out of range."
msgstr ""
"O desprazamento de zona debe estar no intervalo %1..%2 inclusive. %3 está "
"fora de intervalo."

#: xmlpatterns/functions/qtimezonefns.cpp:99
#, qt-format
